2026/07/27 19:53:57 INFO dspy.teleprompt.gepa.gepa: Iteration 3: Proposed new text for generate.predict: ## ImmPort Shared Data – Minimal Metadata API (Blueprint‑Compliant)

### FAIR Alignment
- **Findable** – Persistent DOIs in `@id`/`identifier`; searchable via `/api/study/{id}` (Blueprint §5).
- **Accessible** – `application/ld+json` + OpenAPI docs; token‑based auth for protected data (Blueprint §3.3).
- **Interoperable** – JSON‑LD using schema.org + NIAID context; NCBI Taxon IDs for pathogens (Supplemental Table 7).
- **Reusable** – Clear `license` URL, provenance (`dateCreated`, `dateModified`), citation block with DOI (Blueprint §4.2).

### PID Strategy
- **Dataset DOI** – minted via DataCite REST API, e.g. `https://doi.org/10.1234/immport.sdy998`.  
- **Authors** – ORCID URIs (`https://orcid.org/0000‑0002‑1825‑0097`).  
- **Funder** – ROR URI (`https://ror.org/02x2f7339`).  
*(Describe the automated workflow.)*

### Recommended Endpoints
| Method | Path | Description | Auth |
|--------|------|-------------|------|
| GET | `/api/study/{studyId}` | Retrieve latest study metadata (JSON/JSON‑LD) | Bearer |
| GET | `/api/study/{studyId}/versions` | List all versions | Bearer |
| GET | `/api/study/{studyId}/versions/{versionId}` | Retrieve a specific version | Bearer |
| POST | `/api/query` | Bulk search with filters | Bearer |
| GET | `/api/context` | Return the Blueprint JSON‑LD context | Public |
| GET | `/api/openapi.json` | OpenAPI 3.0 document | Public |

### Query Parameters (for `/api/study/{studyId}`)
| Name | In | Type | Required | Description |
|------|----|------|----------|-------------|
| `format` | query | string | No | `json` (default) or `jsonld` |
| `fields` | query | string | No | Comma‑separated whitelist |
| `version` | query | string | No | Explicit version ID |
| `asOf` | query | string (ISO‑8601) | No | Snapshot at given timestamp |
| `page` | query | integer | No | 1‑based page number |
| `pageSize` | query | integer | No | Items per page (max 500) |
| `cursor` | query | string | No | Opaque token for next page |
| `includeHistory` | query | boolean | No | Return version history |

### JSON‑LD Context (`https://immport.org/api/context/v1.jsonld`)
```json
