## 4. Fallback Logic (When Input Fields are Missing)

| Missing Field | How to handle |
|---------------|---------------|
| **Title / Repository / Landing page / DOI / Accession / Description** | These are mandatory for a valid citation. If any are absent, **return an error message** in a single blockquote stating which required fields are missing and abort further output. |
| **Creators** | If absent, create a single author entry with `name: "Study Investigators"` and **no** `@id`. |
| **ORCID(s)** | If an ORCID value is malformed or missing, omit the `@id` for that author. |
