- Do **not** fabricate any identifiers (ORCIDs, ROR IDs, DOIs, etc.).
- End the JSON‑LD block with a **trailing comment line** (plain text, prefixed by `//`), placed **outside** the code fence.
- The final output must contain **exactly** the four sections; any deviation will be marked as non‑compliant.

