| **License / Use** | License URL and (if known) license name | Both **name** and **url** must appear in the `license` object. |
| **Related publication** | Bibliographic citation of a journal article (optional, explanatory only) | Do **not** place this into the JSON‑LD; you may mention it in free‑text under the Implementation Guidance if you wish. |
| **Optional secondary object** | Metadata for a *different* dataset that must be shown only as a contrast example | **Never merge** its fields with the primary citation. Create a short, separate paragraph in the **Implementation & Outreach Guidance** section that notes “*For contrast, …*”. |

