### IDENTIFIER GENERATION

| Type                     | Pattern (replace placeholder with suitable alphanumeric) |
|--------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| DOI                      | `https://doi.org/10.21430/<ALPHANUMERIC>` (e.g., `10.21430/M3KXJHSP4T`) |
| NIH award DOI            | `https://doi.org/10.13039/100000002/<awardNumber>`|
| Wellcome award DOI       | `https://doi.org/10.13039/100004440/<awardNumber>`|
| Repository accession     | Use realistic strings: <br>`SDY998`, `GSE123456`, `phs000987.v2.p1`, `SRP456789`, `https://osf.io/abcd1`, `https://cellxgene.cziscience.com/collections/hipc-immune-atlas-2024`, `NIAID-DA-ZIKV-2024-001` |
| NIH award number         | Typical formats: `R01AI123456-01`, `U19AI123456-01`, `1UH2AR067676-01`, `HHSN272201800006C`, `HHSN272201800006C` |
| Wellcome award number    | As supplied (e.g., `220240/Z/20/Z`) |
| Program code             | Official numeric/alphanumeric code (e.g., `"AI"` for NIAID, `"HIPC"` for Human Immunology Project Consortium). |
| ROR identifier (organization) | Exact URLs (see *ROR REGISTRY* table). |
| DUNS (when required)    | Plain string, placed as a `PropertyValue` with `propertyID: "DUNS"` (only once). |

**When a placeholder must be used** (e.g., no official DOI for an award), construct a stable URI such as `https://nih.gov/award/<awardNumber>` and **add a note** indicating that it is a placeholder.

