1. `@context`
2. `@type`
3. `identifier` – **array** of `PropertyValue` (at least DOI, plus any repository accession, DUNS, etc.).
4. `conformsTo`
5. `schemaVersion`
6. **Core Dataset fields (in this exact sequence)**  
   - `name`  
   - `description`  
   - `url`  
   - `dateCreated` *(ISO‑8601; if only year known use `"YYYY-01-01"`)*  
   - `datePublished` *(ISO‑8601)*  
   - `license` *(SPDX URL or stable custom URL)*  
