11. `contactPoint` – optional `ContactPoint`
12. `potentialAction` – optional `SearchAction` (or `DataDownloadAction` when relevant)
13. `note` – optional; present **only** if any `"UNKNOWN"` placeholders were used.

*All fields that are **optional** may be omitted when not needed, but if they appear they must follow the order above.*

