### 2.  Core required fields (must be present)

| Field | Expected value / type | Notes |
|-------|-----------------------|-------|
| `@context` | `"https://schema.org/"` **or** a custom context that **imports** this URL | Use the plain URL unless you need to add custom terms. |
| `@type` | `"Dataset"` (or a more specific subclass *only if* it is a recognized schema.org type for the resource) | Do **not** invent new types. |
| `identifier` | `PropertyValue` object with `propertyID` = `"doi"` (or another PID type) and `value` = the persistent identifier | The PID must look realistic (e.g., `10.1234/project.dataset.2024`). |
| `name` | string | Human‑readable title. |
| `description` | string | Brief free‑text description of the dataset. |
| `datePublished` | ISO‑8601 date (`YYYY‑MM‑DD`) | |
| `license` | URL string | Must be a valid licence URL (e.g., CC‑BY‑4.0). |
| `keywords` | array of strings | At least one keyword. |
| `creator` | `Person` **or** `Organization` object with mandatory `name`; if `Person`, also include an `identifier` of type `PropertyValue` where `propertyID` = `"orcid"` and `value` = full ORCID URI. |
| `citation` | **Structured** object – either a `ScholarlyArticle` **or** a `CreativeWork` with at minimum `author`, `datePublished`, `doi` (or other PID) fields. **Do not** use a free‑text string. |
| `host` | **array** of organism objects (see §4) | Must contain at least one entry. |
| `infectiousAgent` | **array** of organism objects (see §4) | Must contain at least one entry. |
| `apiEndpoint` | object describing a minimal REST endpoint (see §5) | Not a free‑text string. |

---

### 3.  Recommended / optional fields (include whenever the scenario supplies the information)

| Field | Type / Content |
|-------|----------------|
| `url` | URL of the dataset landing page |
| `distribution` | array of `DataDownload` objects with `contentUrl`, `encodingFormat`, optional `contentSize` (bytes) |
| `measurementTechnique` | array of strings |
| `about` | array of schema.org `Thing` objects (e.g., disease, assay) |
| `spatialCoverage` | `Place` object (or array) |
| `temporalCoverage` | string or `DateTime` interval |
| `publisher` | `Organization` (e.g., NIAID) |
| `version` | string (e.g., `"1.0"` ) |
| `schemaVersion` | string (e.g., `"NIAID Blueprint v2.0"` ) |
| `isAccessibleForFree` | boolean |
| `accessURL` | URL of the free access page |
| `additionalProperty` | array of `PropertyValue` for any extra FAIR metadata (e.g., `sameAs` links) |

